-- =============================================================================
-- Seed 25 confirmed golf + concert packages - May 2026 catalog refresh
--
-- Source: live Ticketmaster-backed search results gathered 2026-05-02.
-- Existing package rows are deleted per catalog reset; supporting event/artist/venue
-- rows are upserted with stable IDs. New packages default featured=false so
-- operators can choose homepage features in admin.
